Title: Judge's X Word Puzzle No. 11
Author: Mrs. F. C. Clark
Date: 1927-07-09
Byline: Submitted by Mrs. F. C. Clark, Syracuse, N. Y. Judge pays $10 for each puzzle printed
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-07-09_93/page/n29/mode/1up
Puzzle-Number: 11
Solution-Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1927-07-16_93/page/n33/mode/1up


